# Testing

- Domain: `dotnet test tests/PaiSho.Rules.Tests`
- CI runs the same command on PRs.
- Do not claim Unity playmode verification unless an editor run was actually performed.
- Prefer small scenario fixtures (coords + piece types + expected legal moves / outcomes).
